IT:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Mi sento un po' assonnato, ora.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Dovrei stare meglio, dopo aver
fatto un riposino, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Hui! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Ich fühl mich plötzlich so müde.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Nach 'nem kleinen Nickerchen geht's
mir bestimmt besser, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Thanks. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I feel a little better now. {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
But I'm embarrassed you saw me
at my weakest, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sağ ol. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Şimdi daha iyiyim. Ama beni{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
 en güçsüz hâlimde görmen 
biraz utandırdı{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
